<PageLayout
  title="Cookie Policy"
  description="Last updated: July 27, 2026. How StackedTools uses cookies and tracking technologies."
>
  <h2>What Are Cookies?</h2>
  <p>
    Cookies are small text files stored on your device when you visit a website. They help the website remember your preferences, understand how you interact with the site, and deliver relevant advertisements.
  </p>

  <h2>How StackedTools Uses Cookies</h2>
  <p>
    StackedTools uses cookies for the following essential and analytical purposes:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Essential Cookies:</strong> Required for the basic operation and security of the website.</li>
    <li><strong>Analytics Cookies:</strong> Powered by Google Analytics 4 to track anonymized user visits, page views, and traffic sources.</li>
    <li><strong>Advertising Cookies:</strong> Used by Google AdSense to serve personalized or non-personalized ads based on user interests.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Managing Your Cookie Preferences</h2>
  <p>
    You can control or disable cookies at any time through your browser settings. You can also opt out of targeted Google AdSense ads by visiting <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Ad Settings</a>.
  </p>
</PageLayout>
